<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consumer Portfolio.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consumer Portfolio.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffrey said it upgraded Consumer Portfolio Services Inc to strong buy.</p>
<p>-- It also raised its price target to $16 from $13.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 14.</p>
</text>
